# Flightdeck design system

Use this rule whenever you edit UI, styling, layout, or interaction patterns in this repo (`app/`, `components/`, `app/globals.css`).

## Mission

Implementation-ready guidance grounded in this project’s tokens, fonts, and established patterns. A short operator-facing recap lives at **`/design-system`** (`app/design-system/page.tsx`).

## Brand — Flightdeck

Single-pane ops console covering AWS and GitHub. Apple-inspired: calm when healthy, urgent only when something needs attention. Sophisticated, not flashy. Information-dense without feeling crowded.

